From: Colin Foster <colin.foster@in-advantage.com>
Date: Mon, 29 Jun 2026 15:53:44 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] clk: clocking-wizard: fix clock difference detection
References: bsc#1258210
Patch-mainline: 6.18.61
Git-commit: 006ba909c240b832c876b7aed29c6beec9d1f5e5

[ Upstream commit 006ba909c240b832c876b7aed29c6beec9d1f5e5 ]

Reviewed-by: Shubhrajyoti Datta <shubhrajyoti.datta@amd.com>
Reviewed-by: Brian Masney <bmasney@redhat.com>
Signed-off-by: Colin Foster <colin.foster@in-advantage.com>
Signed-off-by: Brian Masney <bmasney@redhat.com>
Signed-off-by: Sasha Levin <sashal@kernel.org>
Signed-off-by: Robert Frohl <rfrohl@suse.com>
---
 drivers/clk/xilinx/clk-xlnx-clock-wizard.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/clk/xilinx/clk-xlnx-clock-wizard.c b/drivers/clk/xilinx/clk-xlnx-clock-wizard.c
index dbef983eb425..4ef0595f7d99 100644
--- a/drivers/clk/xilinx/clk-xlnx-clock-wizard.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/xilinx/clk-xlnx-clock-wizard.c
@@ -406,7 +406,7 @@ static int clk_wzrd_get_divisors(struct clk_hw *hw, unsigned long rate,
 			if (o < omin || o > omax)
 				continue;
 			freq = DIV_ROUND_CLOSEST_ULL(vco_freq, o);
-			diff = freq - rate;
+			diff = abs(freq - rate);
 			if (diff < best_diff) {
 				best_diff = diff;
 				divider->m = m >> 3;
-- 
